<!-- =========================================================
     MISSION & VISION SECTION
========================================================= -->
<section class="about-mission-vision">
    <div class="about-mission-vision-container">

        <!-- ==========OUR MISSION ============ -->
        <div class="about-mv-card about-mission-card">

            <div class="about-mv-heading">
                <div class="about-mv-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i>
                </div>
                <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="about-mv-content">
                <p>
                    Fit 5 Sports Club is India's leading sports training and camp
                    management company serving all children. We provide professional
                    residential summer camps, year-round sports training programs,
                    and comprehensive sports management services for both typical
                    children and those with intellectual disabilities. Our mission
                    is to make quality sports education accessible, inclusive, and
                    transformative for every child.
                </p>

                <p>
                    With certified coaches, modern facilities, and evidence-based
                    training methods, we develop athletic skills, build confidence,
                    and foster teamwork. Our inclusive approach ensures children
                    with intellectual disabilities receive specialized support
                    through adaptive programs while also participating alongside
                    their typical peers where appropriate, creating a truly
                    inclusive sports community.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>


        <!-- =============== OUR VISION============ -->
        <div class="about-mv-card about-vision-card">
            <div class="about-mv-heading">

                <div class="about-mv-icon">
                    <i class="fa-regular fa-star"></i>
                </div>
                <h2>Our Vision</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="about-mv-content">
                <p>
                    We envision a future where every child in India has access to
                    world-class sports training and camp experiences, regardless of
                    ability. We believe sports should be inclusive, accessible, and
                    transformative for all children — from aspiring athletes to those
                    who need adaptive support.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Our goal is to become India's most trusted sports training and
                    camp management company, recognized for professional excellence,
                    inclusive practices, innovative programs, and our commitment to
                    developing every child's potential through sports and outdoor
                    experiences. We see a nation where sports unite communities and
                    every child discovers their potential.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>



<!-- =========================================================
     OUR STORY SECTION
========================================================= -->
<section class="about-story-section">
    <div class="about-story-container">

        <!-- ============= TEXT=========== -->
        <div class="about-story-content">

            <span class="about-story-label">
                Our Story
            </span>

            <h2>
                From a Single Camp to a National Movement
            </h2>

            <div class="about-story-text">
                <p>
                    Fit 5 Sports Club was founded by sports professionals and educators
                    who recognized the need for high-quality, inclusive sports training
                    and camp management in India. We saw that while many sports programs
                    existed, few truly served all children with the same level of
                    professional excellence and inclusive practices.
                </p>

                <p>
                    We started with a single residential summer camp serving 30 children,
                    combining professional sports training with adaptive programs for
                    children with intellectual disabilities. The results exceeded our
                    expectations — children developed athletic skills, built confidence,
                    made lasting friendships, and parents appreciated having a single
                    trusted organization that could serve all their children regardless
                    of ability.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Today, Fit 5 Sports Club operates year-round sports training programs
                    and multiple residential camp sessions serving over 2,000 children
                    annually. We offer training in 15+ sports disciplines and our
                    programs include both mainstream sports training and specialized
                    adaptive programs.
                </p>

                <p>
                    Every year, families trust us with their children because we deliver
                    professional excellence combined with genuine care. Whether your child
                    is a competitive athlete, a beginner, or has intellectual disabilities
                    requiring adaptive support, we create programs that challenge,
                    inspire, and transform.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ============== IMAGE COLLAGE ============ -->
        <div class="about-story-gallery">

            <div class="about-story-gallery-main">
                <img
                    src="/images/about/cycling.jpg"
                    alt="Cycling activities"
                >
            </div>

            <div class="about-story-gallery-small">

                <div class="about-story-gallery-card">
                    <img
                        src="/images/about/basketball.jpg"
                        alt="Basketball activities"
                    >
                </div>

